 ],
 "notes": "Tumi ranges kept once here as r (Alpha, Alpha Bravo) with full line list in the Tumi brand entry; Arrivé, Harrison, Voyageur dropped from this kind (not backpack-specific). School backpack trimmed from 17 to 7 models (2 per main German brand plus Lässig, Scooli) and randoseru made an archetype plus a tradition. Left out (no retrieved page confirming the model): Peak Design Everyday/Travel version years beyond Kickstarter, Osprey Atmos/Exos, Deuter Aircontact/Futura, JanSport Right Pack, Herschel launch year, Tom Bihn founding year (sources give 1972 and 1982). Mystery Ranch 3DAP placed in Daypack; Porter Tanker placed in Daypack as a series."
